- `src/receipt.ts`: `formatReceiptAmount` kept exported but is now a thin wrapper returning `formatMoney(cents, currency)`, fixing the receipt (thousands separator restored, `-1250` cents now renders `-12.50 EUR` instead of `-13.-50 EUR`); `renderReceipt` unchanged for positive amounts.
